    <tags>axis camera-station acs video surveillance vms client</tags>
    <summary>Client for AXIS Camera Station 5 video management software</summary>
    <description>AXIS Camera Station Client connects to AXIS Camera Station servers to view live and recorded video, and to manage cameras and other devices.

This package installs the client only (no server). It requires 64-bit Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.

## Package Parameters
By default the client is installed with firewall rules and a desktop shortcut, telemetry turned off, system TLS settings left alone, and no client launch afterwards.

- `/Telemetry` - Allow Axis to collect usage data (telemetry consent).
- `/DisableTls` - Let the installer turn off TLS 1.0 and 1.1 system-wide. The change takes effect after a reboot.
- `/NoFirewall` - Don't create Windows Firewall rules for the client.
- `/NoDesktopShortcut` - Don't create a desktop shortcut.

Example: `choco install axis-camera-station-client --params "'/NoDesktopShortcut /Telemetry'"`

The installer language is detected from the system's regional settings.
</description>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="netfx-4.8" version="4.8.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
